Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.61,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,辽阔拂远的柔光！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}棱镜愈卫！
