Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高阔凌云的勇气！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飞翼愈卫！
