Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:13.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:16.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:18.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:22.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:24.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谢... 谢谢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:26.59,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.93,0:17:31.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.58,0:17:32.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:36.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:37.46,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:39.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:41.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:42.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:47.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:53.14,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:02.87,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:11.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊... 一片狼藉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:15.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这不就像是蓝天大地一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:21.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,国王和王妃倒下了 护卫队的队长也下落不明...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:25.07,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱小是何等的可怜啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:28.43,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:29.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:34.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地... 一点都... 不弱啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:39.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,人们！都胸怀着希望 努力向前迈进！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:43.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们... 也跟他们一起！努力着！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:46.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,努力着向前迈进！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:56.74,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Prism！Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:18:58.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:00.60,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:04.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！呵呵... 我就教教你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:09.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,管你什么希望 在强大面前 都是没有意义的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:11.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,上！乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:14.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.41,0:19:16.74,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:17.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:18.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,闪光吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:21.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:25.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有力所能及的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:27.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...暴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:31.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,即使只有一点微弱的光芒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.87,0:19:37.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的光芒 能让心与拳变得无敌！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:38.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.80,0:19:41.04,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,出招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
