Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:19:59.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:19:59.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
