Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:46.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不可理喻！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:49.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然输给这种弱者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.37,0:20:53.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对要让你们在我面前卑躬屈膝！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:54.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟 失态了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:01.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们奋战的英姿 让我很佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:04.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我还会来的 虚蜢蜢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:12.44,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:16.33,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天都是小空在一直鼓励我们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:17.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空... 小空空...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想自己走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:24.31,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:29.43,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空空空 小空空空空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！是空太郎啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:32.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:33.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,陪你去到天涯海角！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:39.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,空太郎啊 空太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:47.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,给我一个你篮子里的云面包吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.69,0:21:48.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,（咕）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:50.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚饭吃什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:54.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,煎肉饼 或者炸薯饼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:56.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要吃云面包！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:57.83,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:22:01.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.75,0:22:09.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.75,0:22:09.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}飞翼愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:12.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 请试着跟我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:48.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,让我参加接力跑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 真厉害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.72,0:23:52.35,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我不像小晴跑得那么快...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.57,0:23:54.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在为你加油哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.39,0:23:56.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同学绝对可以的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:59.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:59.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.71,0:24:03.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,递出最棒的一棒！真白全力以赴的接力跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.51,0:02:54.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.31,0:02:59.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:07.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:12.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:16.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:18.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:22.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.13,0:03:27.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:29.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:33.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:37.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:41.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:41.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:43.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:43.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:48.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:53.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:58.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:03.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:06.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:14.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:29.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:34.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:36.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:38.81,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:41.19,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.65,0:22:44.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.11,0:22:46.07,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:48.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:51.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
